List of maintainers for open-dfp-34x-2c
=======================================

This file uses the Linux kernel MAINTAINERS format, so that each component
can gain an entry of its own in the same style. Field letters used here:

	M: Maintainer -- the responsible person, with an e-mail address.
	S: Status -- Supported, Maintained, Odd Fixes, Orphan or Obsolete.
	F: Files and directories; wildcards allowed, a trailing slash means a
	   whole subtree.

One person maintains the whole tree for now, so there is one section. Kernel
code under linux/ additionally keeps its own entries in linux/MAINTAINERS,
upstream style.

